    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Girl's Path to Survival: Research Institute</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixels+transforming into a beautiful girl+high-definition CG+super rich plot+numerous endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{Gameplay Introduction}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Day night system: The time in the game will naturally flow, and the map will also have changes during the day, dusk, and night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Date system: Players will spend seven days in the research institute, during which they can move freely without constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Life system: The protagonist has fatigue level, satiety level, thirst level, and needs to eat, drink, and sleep to maintain physical health. If not taken seriously, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Plot Branches (Key Points): As a role-playing game, there are many plot branches in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter a lot of choices in the game, and each choice will trigger different events, even involving the actions of the relevant characters the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not an exaggeration to say that your choice is related to the fate of the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Multiple endings: Rich endings, each carefully crafted OWO</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{Here is the content introduction}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shocked! A man who left home in the middle of the night was transported by a truck to a different world and turned into a fantastic pink haired beauty?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520350/extras/63f51b015284410b252add15f5d39d58.avif?t=1742659211\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~The peaceful daily life is over. What rushed to the battlefield immediately was the wonderful life of the super cute anime in the different world~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy and lively cat lady roommates, mysterious and dangerous twin ponytail girls, silent white haired little girls wandering around, and even distinguished ladies coming to inspect?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you understand that even the most beautiful life has an end, so you must find a way to {go home} within seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a heartwarming and slightly mysterious story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Girl's Path to Survival: Research Institute</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixels+transforming into a beautiful girl+high-definition CG+super rich plot+numerous endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{Gameplay Introduction}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Day night system: The time in the game will naturally flow, and the map will also have changes during the day, dusk, and night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Date system: Players will spend seven days in the research institute, during which they can move freely without constraints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Life system: The protagonist has fatigue level, satiety level, thirst level, and needs to eat, drink, and sleep to maintain physical health. If not taken seriously, the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Plot Branches (Key Points): As a role-playing game, there are many plot branches in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter a lot of choices in the game, and each choice will trigger different events, even involving the actions of the relevant characters the next day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not an exaggeration to say that your choice is related to the fate of the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Multiple endings: Rich endings, each carefully crafted OWO</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >{Here is the content introduction}</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shocked! A man who left home in the middle of the night was transported by a truck to a different world and turned into a fantastic pink haired beauty?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520350/extras/63f51b015284410b252add15f5d39d58.avif?t=1742659211\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~The peaceful daily life is over. What rushed to the battlefield immediately was the wonderful life of the super cute anime in the different world~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Happy and lively cat lady roommates, mysterious and dangerous twin ponytail girls, silent white haired little girls wandering around, and even distinguished ladies coming to inspect?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you understand that even the most beautiful life has an end, so you must find a way to {go home} within seven days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a heartwarming and slightly mysterious story.</p>",
